WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.780
We produce fundraisers
for South Florida nonprofits.

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:06.845
Our team brings years
of event experience

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:11.960
to planning, sponsor outreach,
vendor logistics, and running the day.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.625
We use one management system
to keep your team connected

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.480
from the first invitation to check-in.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.540
Keep using it year-round
to accept donations,

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:25.060
recruit volunteers,
and offer sponsorship packages.

00:00:25.646 --> 00:00:28.853
That’s Cause on Cue,
our 2027 program.

00:00:29.533 --> 00:00:32.033
Tell us about the fundraiser
you want to produce.
